"HelpChain est une plateforme de coordination opérationnelle conçue comme une"
" infrastructure de continuité opérationnelle pour les organisations."
msgstr ""
"HelpChain is an operational coordination platform designed as an operational"
" continuity infrastructure for organizations."

#: about.html:110
msgid ""
"Pensée pour les structures publiques, associatives et professionnelles "
"opérant en France, la plateforme HelpChain soutient un cadre de traitement "
"lisible, traçable, pilotable et durable dans le temps."
msgstr ""
"Designed for public, association, and professional organizations operating "
"in France, HelpChain supports a clear, traceable, manageable, and "
"sustainable operating framework."

