#: collectivites_associations.html:12
msgid "Pour les collectivités et associations"
msgstr "For communities and associations"

#: collectivites_associations.html:3
msgid ""
"La plateforme HelpChain pour collectivités, CCAS, associations structurées "
"et services locaux : continuité opérationnelle, suivi multi-acteurs, "
"pilotage des situations sociales et traçabilité native."
msgstr ""
"The HelpChain platform for local authorities, CCAS, structured associations,"
" and local services: operational continuity, multi-actor follow-up, "
"management of social situations, and built-in traceability."

#: collectivites_associations.html:6
msgid "Aperçu de la page Pour les collectivités et associations"
msgstr "Page Overview For Communities and Associations"

#: collectivites_associations.html:11
msgid "Collectivités & associations"
msgstr "Local authorities and associations"

#: collectivites_associations.html:14
msgid ""
"La plateforme HelpChain aide les collectivités, CCAS, associations "
"structurées et services locaux à organiser le suivi des situations sociales "
"dans un cadre commun, lisible et traçable."
msgstr ""
"HelpChain helps local authorities, CCAS, structured associations, and local "
"services organize the follow-up of social situations within a shared, clear,"
" and traceable framework."

#: collectivites_associations.html:17
msgid ""
"La plateforme HelpChain ne remplace pas les structures existantes : elle "
"apporte une infrastructure de coordination opérationnelle pour clarifier les"
" demandes, les responsabilités, les priorités et les actions engagées."
msgstr ""
"HelpChain does not replace existing organizations: it provides operational "
"coordination infrastructure to clarify requests, responsibilities, "
"priorities, and actions taken."

#: collectivites_associations.html:22
msgid "Un cadre de coordination opérationnelle"
msgstr "An operational coordination framework"

#: collectivites_associations.html:23
msgid ""
"HelpChain permet de regrouper les demandes, de structurer leur traitement et"
" de suivre leur évolution dans un cadre partagé entre acteurs habilités."
msgstr ""
"HelpChain brings requests together, structures their handling, and tracks "
"their progress in a shared framework among authorized actors."

#: collectivites_associations.html:25
msgid "Visualiser les demandes en cours."
msgstr "View ongoing requests."

#: collectivites_associations.html:26 pilotage_indicateurs.html:37
msgid "Suivre l’avancement des situations."
msgstr "Track the progress of situations."

#: collectivites_associations.html:27
msgid "Clarifier les responsabilités."
msgstr "Clarify responsibilities."

#: collectivites_associations.html:28
msgid "Coordonner les actions entre services, associations ou partenaires."
msgstr "Coordinate actions among services, associations, or partners."

#: collectivites_associations.html:33
msgid "Une meilleure visibilité des situations"
msgstr "Better visibility into situations"

#: collectivites_associations.html:34
msgid ""
"Les structures disposent d’une lecture plus claire des situations suivies, "
"des statuts, des priorités et des actions engagées."
msgstr ""
"Organizations gain a clearer view of tracked situations, statuses, "
"priorities, and actions taken."

#: collectivites_associations.html:36
msgid "Identifier les situations prioritaires."
msgstr "Identify priority situations."

#: collectivites_associations.html:37
msgid "Réduire la dispersion des informations."
msgstr "Reduce information fragmentation."

#: collectivites_associations.html:38
msgid "Suivre les actions dans la durée."
msgstr "Track actions over time."

#: collectivites_associations.html:39
msgid "Consolider une vision utile au pilotage local."
msgstr "Build a useful view for local operations."

#: collectivites_associations.html:44
msgid "Un appui aux organisations existantes"
msgstr "Support for existing organizations"

#: collectivites_associations.html:45
msgid ""
"HelpChain s’intègre dans les pratiques des structures sans imposer une "
"rupture brutale avec les circuits existants."
msgstr ""
"HelpChain fits into organizations’ practices without forcing an abrupt break"
" with existing processes."

#: collectivites_associations.html:46
msgid ""
"Le dispositif agit comme un cadre complémentaire pour structurer les flux, "
"fiabiliser le suivi et faciliter la coordination entre acteurs autorisés."
msgstr ""
"The solution acts as a complementary framework to structure flows, make "
"follow-up more reliable, and facilitate coordination among authorized "
"actors."

#: collectivites_associations.html:50
msgid "Données, confidentialité et accès"
msgstr "Data, privacy, and access"

#: collectivites_associations.html:51
msgid ""
"HelpChain est conçu selon les principes du RGPD, avec une logique de "
"minimisation des données, de contrôle des accès et de traçabilité des "
"actions importantes."
msgstr ""
"HelpChain is designed around GDPR principles, with data minimization, access"
" control, and traceability of important actions."

#: collectivites_associations.html:52
msgid ""
"Les informations traitées doivent rester proportionnées aux finalités de "
"coordination, de suivi et de pilotage opérationnel."
msgstr ""
"Processed information must remain proportionate to the purposes of "
"coordination, follow-up, and operational management."

#: collectivites_associations.html:56
msgid "Un déploiement progressif"
msgstr "Phased deployment"

#: collectivites_associations.html:57
msgid ""
"Le déploiement peut commencer sur un périmètre limité : une équipe, un "
"service, un type de demande ou un territoire restreint."
msgstr ""
"Deployment can begin within a limited scope: one team, service, request "
"type, or restricted territory."

#: collectivites_associations.html:58
msgid ""
"Cette approche permet de valider les usages, les rôles, les indicateurs et "
"les règles de gouvernance avant un élargissement éventuel."
msgstr ""
"This approach makes it possible to validate usage, roles, indicators, and "
"governance rules before any potential expansion."

#: analyses/le_cout_invisible_des_relances_perdues.html:108
#: analyses/pourquoi_les_suivis_se_fragmentent.html:108
#: collectivites_associations.html:62 comment_ca_marche.html:107 faq.html:103
#: partenariats.html:65 pourquoi_helpchain.html:80 vision_europeenne.html:52
msgid "Conclusion"
msgstr "Conclusion"

#: collectivites_associations.html:63
msgid ""
"HelpChain aide les structures locales à passer d’un suivi dispersé à une "
"coordination plus structurée, partagée et pilotable."
msgstr ""
"HelpChain helps local organizations move from fragmented follow-up to more "
"structured, shared, and manageable coordination."

#: collectivites_associations.html:64
msgid ""
"La plateforme soutient l’organisation, le suivi et la coordination des "
"situations sociales sans remplacer les décisions métier ni les circuits "
"institutionnels existants."
msgstr ""
"The platform supports the organization, follow-up, and coordination of "
"social situations without replacing professional decisions or existing "
"institutional processes."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:2 comment_ca_marche.html:4
msgid ""
"Comment fonctionne HelpChain | Coordination opérationnelle inter-structures"
msgstr "How HelpChain Works | Inter-organization operational coordination"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:3
msgid ""
"Fonctionnement de la plateforme HelpChain : enregistrement, qualification, "
"orientation, continuité inter-structures, suivi multi-acteurs, traçabilité "
"native et pilotage opérationnel."
msgstr ""
"How the HelpChain platform works: registration, qualification, referral, "
"inter-organization continuity, multi-actor follow-up, native traceability, "
"and operational management."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:6
msgid "Aperçu de la page Comment fonctionne HelpChain"
msgstr "Preview of the How HelpChain Works page"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:11 partials/navbar_public.html:14
#: volunteer_onboarding.html:13
msgid "Fonctionnement"
msgstr "How it works"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:12
msgid "Comment fonctionne HelpChain"
msgstr "How HelpChain Works"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:14
msgid ""
"La plateforme HelpChain organise le traitement des demandes sociales autour "
"d’un enchaînement lisible : enregistrement, qualification, orientation, "
"suivi multi-acteurs et pilotage."
msgstr ""
"The HelpChain platform organizes social request handling around a clear "
"flow: registration, qualification, referral, multi-actor follow-up, and "
"management."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:17
msgid ""
"La plateforme HelpChain aide les organisations locales, associations, "
"collectivités et acteurs habilités à garder une lecture claire des "
"priorités, des responsabilités et des actions engagées."
msgstr ""
"The HelpChain platform helps local organizations, associations, local "
"authorities, and authorized actors maintain a clear view of priorities, "
"responsibilities, and actions taken."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:22
msgid "1. Enregistrer la demande"
msgstr "1. Register the request"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:23
msgid ""
"Une demande peut être saisie par un service, un acteur habilité ou via un "
"canal d’entrée défini par l’organisation."
msgstr ""
"A request can be entered by a service, an authorized actor, or through an "
"intake channel defined by the organization."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:24
msgid ""
"Les informations utiles sont rassemblées dès l’entrée : contexte, périmètre "
"concerné, premiers repères de suivi et éléments nécessaires à la "
"qualification."
msgstr ""
"Useful information is gathered at intake: context, scope, initial follow-up "
"markers, and details needed for qualification."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:28
msgid "2. Qualifier et hiérarchiser"
msgstr "2. Qualify and prioritize"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:29
msgid ""
"La demande est analysée selon sa nature, son degré d’urgence, son statut et "
"les informations indispensables à une prise en charge responsable."
msgstr ""
"The request is analyzed by nature, urgency, status, and information "
"essential for responsible handling."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:31
msgid "Repérer les dossiers sensibles."
msgstr "Identify sensitive cases."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:32
msgid "Objectiver le niveau de priorité."
msgstr "Objectify the priority level."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:33
msgid "Limiter la dispersion de l’information."
msgstr "Limit information fragmentation."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:34
msgid "Préparer une orientation cohérente."
msgstr "Prepare a coherent referral."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:39
msgid "3. Orienter ou attribuer"
msgstr "3. Refer or assign"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:40
msgid ""
"Le dossier peut ensuite être orienté vers le service, l’équipe ou l’acteur "
"habilité concerné, selon les règles définies localement."
msgstr ""
"The case can then be referred to the relevant service, team, or authorized "
"actor according to local rules."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:41
msgid ""
"Cette étape clarifie qui prend le relais, avec quelle responsabilité et quel"
" niveau de visibilité."
msgstr ""
"This step clarifies who takes over, with what responsibility and level of "
"visibility."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:47
msgid "Coordination partenaire sécurisée"
msgstr "Secure partner coordination"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:49
msgid ""
"Lorsqu’une situation nécessite l’intervention d’une autre structure, "
"HelpChain permet d’orienter une demande vers un partenaire autorisé, sans "
"exposer l’intégralité du dossier interne."
msgstr ""
"When a situation requires another organization, HelpChain can refer a "
"request to an authorized partner without exposing the entire internal case."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:52
msgid "Validation bilatérale des structures partenaires"
msgstr "Bilateral validation of partner organizations"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:53
msgid "Partage contrôlé des informations utiles"
msgstr "Controlled sharing of useful information"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:54
msgid "Suivi opérationnel partagé"
msgstr "Shared operational follow-up"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:55
msgid "Historique et traçabilité des échanges"
msgstr "History and traceability of exchanges"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:56
msgid "Cloisonnement des données internes"
msgstr "Segmentation of internal data"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:59
msgid ""
"Chaque orientation reste cloisonnée, tracée et gouvernée selon les droits "
"définis par la structure."
msgstr ""
"Each referral remains segmented, traceable, and governed according to the "
"organization’s defined rights."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:61
msgid "Parcours d’orientation partenaire"
msgstr "Partner referral journey"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:62 public/pour_les_structures.html:349
msgid "CCAS"
msgstr "CCAS"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:63
msgid "Structure partenaire"
msgstr "Partner organization"

#: admin/referrals/index.html:15 comment_ca_marche.html:64
msgid "Prise en charge"
msgstr "Case handling"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:65
msgid "Suivi partagé"
msgstr "Shared follow-up"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:66 public/pour_les_structures.html:503
msgid "Clôture"
msgstr "Closure"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:73
msgid ""
"Vue HelpChain affichant une relation partenaire active entre deux structures"
" autorisées."
msgstr ""
"HelpChain view showing an active partner relationship between two authorized"
" organizations."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:78
msgid "Connexion partenaire active entre structures autorisées."
msgstr "Active partner connection between authorized organizations."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:79
msgid "Validation bilatérale • partage contrôlé • suivi opérationnel"
msgstr "Bilateral validation • controlled sharing • operational follow-up"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:84
msgid "4. Coordonner et suivre"
msgstr "4. Coordinate and follow up"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:85
msgid ""
"Les actions engagées sont suivies dans un espace commun de coordination afin"
" de conserver une lecture partagée de l’avancement."
msgstr ""
"Actions taken are followed in a shared coordination space to preserve a "
"shared view of progress."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:87
msgid "Visualiser les dossiers en cours."
msgstr "View active cases."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:88
msgid "Suivre les statuts, étapes et relances."
msgstr "Follow statuses, stages, and follow-ups."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:89
msgid "Documenter les décisions et actions importantes."
msgstr "Document important decisions and actions."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:90
msgid "Maintenir la continuité entre acteurs autorisés."
msgstr "Maintain continuity between authorized actors."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:95
msgid "5. Piloter et consolider"
msgstr "5. Manage and consolidate"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:96
msgid ""
"Les équipes disposent d’une vision consolidée des demandes, des priorités, "
"des responsabilités et de l’activité réelle."
msgstr ""
"Teams have a consolidated view of requests, priorities, responsibilities, "
"and actual activity."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:97
msgid ""
"Cette relecture facilite le pilotage opérationnel, l’amélioration continue "
"et la préparation d’un déploiement plus large lorsque les modalités sont "
"validées."
msgstr ""
"This review supports operational management, continuous improvement, and "
"preparation for wider deployment once the arrangements are validated."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:101
msgid "Données, accès et confidentialité"
msgstr "Data, access, and privacy"

#: comment_ca_marche.html:102
msgid ""
"HelpChain est conçu selon une logique de minimisation des données, de "
"contrôle des accès et de traçabilité des actions sensibles."
msgstr ""
"HelpChain is designed around data minimization, access control, and "
"traceability of sensitive actions."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:103
msgid ""
"Les droits sont organisés selon les rôles, les responsabilités et le "
"périmètre d’intervention défini par l’organisation."
msgstr ""
"Rights are organized according to roles, responsibilities, and the "
"organization’s defined scope of intervention."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:108
msgid ""
"HelpChain transforme un suivi dispersé en une coordination plus lisible, "
"traçable et pilotable."
msgstr ""
"HelpChain transforms fragmented follow-up into clearer, traceable, "
"manageable coordination."

#: comment_ca_marche.html:109
msgid ""
"La plateforme soutient l’organisation des demandes sociales, sans remplacer "
"les décisions métier ni les circuits institutionnels existants."
msgstr ""
"The platform supports the organization of social requests without replacing "
"professional decisions or existing institutional processes."

