"infrastructure de coordination opérationnelle conçue pour des environnements"
" structurés."
msgstr ""
"HelpChain is not simply a matchmaking tool. It is an operational "
"coordination infrastructure designed for structured environments."

#: public/pour_les_structures.html:515
