"prestataires ou sous-traitants impliquent un accès ou un transfert hors de "
"l’Union européenne, HelpChain veille à l’existence de garanties appropriées "
"conformément au RGPD, notamment par le recours aux clauses contractuelles "
"types de la Commission européenne lorsque cela est applicable."
msgstr ""
"To HelpChain’s knowledge, the platform is operated with the aim of "
"maintaining contractual and technical control over processing. Where certain"
" providers or processors involve access to or a transfer outside the "
"European Union, HelpChain ensures that appropriate safeguards exist under "
"the GDPR, including the European Commission’s standard contractual clauses "
"where applicable."

